{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-02_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-02","title":"有口难言","storyCode":"5-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e5e8da8abac73aa533718d1f1b4a8d61a11cd77110c688552de8c84f987a9411","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"诗怀雅并不如她表现的那样刻薄，但情况确实如她所说的糟糕。\n在一则机密通讯过后，陈决定请求罗德岛的协助。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"诗怀雅，你没有这个权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"即使放下我们之间的私怨，我也不觉得你有这个能力来获得这份任命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至可以口头声明——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"“魏彦吾已向施警司发布命令，即刻起，施警司将接管近卫局一切事务，并罢免现行动组长，予以撤职处分”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你能吗？这条命令真的存在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......别这么叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不能，就请你去完成自己的任务，现在接下这个烫手山芋对你没有好处，“诗小姐”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"*龙门粗口*，说过多少次了，我不姓施！听好，我的代号是诗怀雅，或者叫我碧翠克斯·施怀雅警官，懂吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你那套规矩关我*龙门粗口*，你这代号和姓氏，普通人听了有谁知道区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的我既没时间也没这个心情。请你让开点，自己去找点事做，乖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"姓陈的......你可真是*龙门粗口*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你*龙门粗口*富贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了，星熊。劝你管住这条疯龙，她死在哪里和我可是一点关系都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，抱歉，“小姐”。你们的脾气其实都真够差的。不管她怎么说，刚才的援助还是谢谢你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"下次不会了，我要看着她血流不止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她的背怎么了？像是新伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"她夹着你冲进了掩体，整合运动术师的法术在她背后三米的墙上炸开了花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"偶尔也对她好点，没必要什么时候都互相针对成这个样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"敲门声"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以进来吗，龙门的陈长官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"进来吧。她不介意。不好意思，让你久等了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事，不用见外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，陈长官。嗯......现在方便和罗德岛这边磋商一下任务内容吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经集结了数支小队，他们正在甲板待命，准备好了随时和你们一同出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我马上就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉听到了你和那位金发警官之间的对话......我们知道近卫局损失惨重。你可以相信我们，罗德岛能帮得上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是我们现在该讨论的话题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别介意，星熊。你也很清楚诗怀雅在做什么，她是在稳定局势。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"她火气上头，你也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是顺水推舟了一把。龙门损失惨重，这是“事实”，他们都应当知道的“事实”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这不好，也不像是你会做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这是为了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说话更不像你了，你是探长，是高级警司，不是政客，逢场作戏从来都不是你的天职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实不是一个正规的警员该做的事，但我别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你太累了，需要好好放个假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可能吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......我确实想过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，我需要一次很长很长的休假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"等这次的事情结束以后就去吧，别死撑着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"黄城，或者春都？要么就花郡吧，黄城离这里太远了，花在路上的时间够再休一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"还是回维多利亚见见校友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去你的家乡看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"别去，没龙门有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......是机密频道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_5_2_call"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"请说，我在听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir......那些感染者，整合运动......到处都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"XR02？你在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"木禾仓库。我中了几箭，应该活不长了。这是陷阱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等他们都走了你再来这里。那个情报，我会留在身上。他们不会懂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"代号XR02，你在那里等着。近卫局会立刻赶过去。你手上的情报有时效性，我们必须拿到手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定，陈sir。你有你的任务，我不想拖累你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"XR02，不准死。你必须活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我没法说服你，陈sir。你们要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，有动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"【电流声】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"XR02？XR02！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"去整备队伍吧，我们该走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，你要出发了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛还剩下多少武装力量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这不在可交换情报里，陈长官。我们接到的命令是辅助近卫局行动，但不能直接听从你的调遣，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像还没提出这种要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉，多言了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。我只是想询问下罗德岛的状况，问问你们有没有安保上的难题，是否需要近卫局的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动多次被击退，已经放弃进攻罗德岛本舰了。从种种迹象来看，龙门的形势要比罗德岛严峻得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，这样形容好像不太对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，你们并不需要近卫局的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那么暂时地，近卫局确实需要你们一点小小的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动封锁了接驳区域的主干道。我需要打开一个缺口。近卫局的时间不多，请各位争分夺秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这是协议内容，长官，我们义不容辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。跟我来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["诗怀雅"]}]}
